  "question": "Where is the nearest restaurant along the route from Hamtramck Disneyland, Hamtramck, MI to University of Michigan Museum of Natural\u00a0History, Ann Arbor, MI?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.058623 42.407216)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.734255 42.278857)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'restaurant'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.058623 42.407216)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-83.058623 42.407216)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
